    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapy doesn't change the fact that he's gone. it just feels like i'm performing being alive. sometimes i just stare at the wall and think about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to wake up to this anymore. if i could just... be with him, everything would finally be quiet. i just want the pain to stop.",
