    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but memories just make the holes deeper. they aren't enough to fill the space he left. it feels like i'm just a ghost wandering through a life i don't even want anymore. if i could just close my eyes and not have to face this every single morning... wouldn't that just be more peaceful? it feels like the only way to actually find rest.",
